  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>About: Reads the Matched NETC xlsx, groups STP tolls per highway toll plaza pool (GL-9908), checks each pool balances&#xd;&#xa;(plaza toll = GL-9908), computes acquirer interchange (ACQUIRER_INTERCHANGE_PCT, default 1.5%) and net concessionaire payout,&#xd;&#xa;then POSTs one balancing settlement journal (DR toll pool / CR concessionaire payable / CR acquirer interchange) with the&#xd;&#xa;per-plaza breakdown and closeClearingCycle=true to NPCI_URL. Idempotency-Key = run id.&#xd;&#xa;&#xd;&#xa;Runtime params: Matched_File_Path, NPCI_URL (default http://localhost:8000/api/recon/run). Config: ACQUIRER_INTERCHANGE_PCT, OUTPUT_DIR.&#xd;&#xa;Success message: &#x22;NETC Concessionaire Knock-off Posted - Toll Pool Balanced&#x22;.&#xd;&#xa;Errors: inputs validated; any unbalanced pool or non-STP row blocks posting (Failure); empty file = Diverted; API connection&#xd;&#xa;failure / non-2xx = Failure. Excel outputs attached to the result: NETC_Plaza_Pool_Settlement_&lt;ts&gt;.xlsx, NETC_Concessionaire_Knockoff_Audit_&lt;ts&gt;.xlsx.</note>
      <xloc>64</xloc>
